# ── frontend build context — was MISSING entirely (audit: fix/coolify-production-readiness) ────
# Mirrors admin-frontend/.dockerignore's categories, adapted for this Next.js app's own build
# artifacts (.next instead of Vite's dist/build). Without this file, the Dockerfile's `COPY . .`
# pulls in whatever happens to be sitting in the build context — confirmed at audit time to
# include two tracked-but-scratch files at this directory's root (test-acc.txt,
# tmp_api_check.json) that have no runtime purpose, plus whatever local node_modules/.next a
# developer's own checkout happens to have on disk.

.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.next
.env
.env.*
*.log
.vscode
.idea
.cursor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# -- Local scratch files observed at this directory's root at audit time --
test-acc.txt
tmp_api_check.json
